WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 12.4 · Partnerships & Ecosystem Building
Partner selection and due diligence

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Check fit and safety before committing, in proportion to money, data and people.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Check more when children, data or money are involved.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Expect partners to check you too.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Record the decision and any conditions.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Vanita Weavers Cooperative (Cooperative · member-owned, India)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“Vanita: a retail chain paying in 75–90 days. Continue only with payment in 45 days, approved by the committee.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You write proportionate checks and assess one prospect.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
